From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Apr 2026 17:08:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] rocroller gcc 16/fedora 44 include fixes

Include cstdint and unistd.h in places
where they are not anymore included by
other header files.

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
---
 ...cc-16-fedora-44-uint32_t-include-fix.patch | 29 ++++++++++++++++++
 ...-gcc-16-fedora-44-usleep-include-fix.patch | 30 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 59 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 patches/amd-mainline/rocm-libraries/0002-rocroller-gcc-16-fedora-44-uint32_t-include-fix.patch
 create mode 100644 patches/amd-mainline/rocm-libraries/0003-rocroller-gcc-16-fedora-44-usleep-include-fix.patch

diff --git a/patches/amd-mainline/rocm-libraries/0002-rocroller-gcc-16-fedora-44-uint32_t-include-fix.patch b/patches/amd-mainline/rocm-libraries/0002-rocroller-gcc-16-fedora-44-uint32_t-include-fix.patch
