+++ b/patches/amd-mainline/rocm-libraries/0002-rocroller-gcc-16-fedora-44-uint32_t-include-fix.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+From 014240998790dd30f7ab14d63a5ceff927e47f52 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
+Date: Wed, 29 Apr 2026 16:57:02 -0700
+Subject: [PATCH 2/3] rocroller gcc 16/fedora 44 uint32_t include fix
+
+Never gcc versions requires including the
+ctdint.h or cstdint implicitly to resolve
+following:
+    error: unknown type name 'uint32_t'
+
+Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
